WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:09.216
"Jason's here!" Bobby cried.

2
00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:11.714
Jason ran to his friends.

3
00:00:11.715 --> 00:00:13.797
It was summertime.

4
00:00:13.798 --> 00:00:17.770
Everyone was taking a cooking class together at a farm.

5
00:00:17.771 --> 00:00:21.252
Jason couldn't wait to see what they cooked first!

6
00:00:21.253 --> 00:00:24.577
"We're all here now," Nina said.

7
00:00:24.578 --> 00:00:28.988
"Except for Ethan," Izzie said.

8
00:00:28.989 --> 00:00:33.702
"He's having fun surfing in California," Bobby said.

9
00:00:33.703 --> 00:00:38.270
"Well . . ." Jason grinned.

10
00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:45.117
"We'll be having fun with a real chef!"

11
00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:47.638
A tall man came over.

12
00:00:47.639 --> 00:00:53.228
"My name is Charles. But my students call me Chef.

13
00:00:53.229 --> 00:01:00.317
I'll show you junior chefs around the farm. Follow me."

14
00:01:00.318 --> 00:01:05.022
"He seems serious," Nina whispered.

15
00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:08.864
"He's a real chef," Jason said.

16
00:01:08.865 --> 00:01:13.230
"So, he is serious—about cooking!"

17
00:01:13.231 --> 00:01:16.529
Several chickens ran around the farmyard.

18
00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:21.959
"Aw!" Izzie saw goats too.

19
00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.790
"Look at the cute goats in their pen!"

20
00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:28.739
Chef gave the kids baskets.

21
00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:32.262
"We're making omelets today," he said.

22
00:01:32.263 --> 00:01:36.797
"Let's go to the coop to gather eggs."

23
00:01:36.798 --> 00:01:41.167
At the coop the kids began collecting eggs from nests.

24
00:01:41.168 --> 00:01:44.728
"Be careful not to crack them," Chef said.

25
00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:49.712
"We can't use cracked ones. And I don't like to waste food!"

26
00:01:49.713 --> 00:01:53.404
A big dog ran up, wagging her tail.

27
00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:56.084
"This is Cinnamon," Chef said.

28
00:01:56.085 --> 00:02:01.412
"At least the dog is friendly," Bobby whispered.

29
00:02:01.413 --> 00:02:07.082
Finally they went into the farmhouse kitchen.

30
00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:13.136
"It's huge," Jason said.

31
00:02:13.137 --> 00:02:17.998
Chef nodded. "This is my first class for kids. But . . ."

32
00:02:17.999 --> 00:02:21.371
He pointed to a poster of kitchen safety rules.

33
00:02:21.372 --> 00:02:25.855
"I expect you to follow the same rules that grown-up cooks follow."

34
00:02:25.856 --> 00:02:29.504
"Chef is mean!" Izzie whispered.

35
00:02:29.505 --> 00:02:32.545
"No, he's not," Jason said.

36
00:02:32.546 --> 00:02:36.941
Jason saw a recipe for a cheese omelet on a screen.

37
00:02:36.942 --> 00:02:40.871
"That recipe looks easy!" Bobby said.

38
00:02:40.872 --> 00:02:44.676
Chef frowned. "It's a simple recipe.

39
00:02:44.677 --> 00:02:47.837
But making an omelet is not easy.

40
00:02:47.838 --> 00:02:53.219
Folding it can be difficult. Let's get started."

41
00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:57.638
The kids washed their hands and put on aprons.

42
00:02:57.639 --> 00:03:00.850
Nina read the instructions.

43
00:03:00.851 --> 00:03:04.538
"First we have to crack the eggs."

44
00:03:04.539 --> 00:03:07.945
"I'll crack them!" Bobby said.

45
00:03:07.946 --> 00:03:11.895
"No, no! Not against the bowl!" Chef snapped.

46
00:03:11.896 --> 00:03:14.839
"Crack them on a flat surface."

47
00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.967
Nina and Bobby carefully cracked two eggs into a bowl.

48
00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:24.000
Bobby added salt and black pepper and whisked the mixture a few times.

49
00:03:24.001 --> 00:03:27.937
"Keep whisking!" Chef said.

50
00:03:27.938 --> 00:03:31.288
The eggs were finally ready.

51
00:03:31.289 --> 00:03:36.278
Chef heated a pan on the stove and melted the butter.

52
00:03:36.279 --> 00:03:38.617
"We can add the eggs now."

53
00:03:38.618 --> 00:03:40.893
Nina poured in the eggs.

54
00:03:40.894 --> 00:03:43.580
They cooked for a few minutes.

55
00:03:43.581 --> 00:03:47.199
Then Izzie sprinkled cheese on one side.

56
00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:51.710
"Now we'll fold half of the omelet over the cheese," Chef said.

57
00:03:51.711 --> 00:03:56.297
"Can I do it?" Jason asked. "I know how!"

58
00:03:56.298 --> 00:04:01.210
Chef handed over a spatula. "Be careful."

59
00:04:01.211 --> 00:04:04.648
Jason loosened the omelet's edges.

60
00:04:04.649 --> 00:04:07.138
He could feel Chef's eyes on him.

61
00:04:07.139 --> 00:04:11.102
When he tried to fold the omelet, his hand shook.

62
00:04:11.103 --> 00:04:13.102
It broke apart!

63
00:04:13.103 --> 00:04:17.508
"The omelet is ruined!" Chef sighed.

64
00:04:17.509 --> 00:04:24.975
"Let's just eat it and make another one."

65
00:04:24.976 --> 00:04:28.900
Jason hung his head as Chef passed out servings.

66
00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:31.836
"Izzie's right," he thought.

67
00:04:31.837 --> 00:04:34.926
"Chef is mean."

68
00:04:34.927 --> 00:04:38.933
"Yum!" Nina and Izzie said.

69
00:04:38.934 --> 00:04:42.310
"Best omelet ever!" Bobby said.

70
00:04:42.311 --> 00:04:46.843
Something amazing happened. Chef smiled!

71
00:04:46.844 --> 00:04:52.291
"The omelet doesn't look perfect, but it tastes wonderful. Good job."

72
00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:55.209
Chef Charles nodded at Jason.

73
00:04:55.210 --> 00:05:01.482
Chef Jason grinned—and took a taste.

